{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cdb0274f-f569-8963-b8d1-ff524d5e4a69",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T14:34:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:32:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Finance Department, Janet Whitcomb speaking. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:32:58-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I got a parking ticket and I want to contest it. I'm not sure how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Certainly. Do you have the ticket in front of you? I'll need the ticket number and the plate number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:33:12-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, hold on, I've got you on speaker so I can dig it out. [pause] Okay, the ticket number is four, four, seven, one, nine, two. Plate is Rhode Island, one, A, B, three, nine, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I have that here. It was issued on Saturday, is that correct, on a street near the waterfront?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, Saturday. It says I was in a snow emergency zone, but that nor'easter that ended Saturday was wicked, and I didn't see any signs. I'd gotten up before dawn to catch an early train, so I was gone way before anything got posted, I think."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. You have the right to contest it. You'll need to submit a written request to contest the ticket, either by mail or in person, within the period printed on the ticket. Once it's received, the matter is scheduled for a hearing before the municipal court clerk's office, and you'll be notified of the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:08-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what happens at the hearing? Do I just show up and explain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:14-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. You appear, state your case, and present anything supporting it, such as photographs or a train ticket showing your travel time. The hearing officer then makes a determination."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So, um, do you have the hearing date for mine?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:30-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I'm looking at the record. No hearing has been scheduled yet, because a contest hasn't been filed. The date will be assigned after we receive your request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. So I file first and then they send the date."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's correct. It will be mailed to the address on your registration. Is there anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T14:34:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
